ne a taigi den taki : “ wan guest fu a osu fu den guduman , ne a guduman sama á be teke wan pikin sikapu di a taki fu a guests , ma a teke a pikin sikapu fu a pootiwan de gi en guests . 
we , di kownu dafeti paansu walaki anga a man , fu go , ne a taigi en taki : “ nathan taki : “ mi abi wan sworn na a gaan masaa fu hosts efu wan sama taki , a ná o dede . 
a taki : “ a o pai fu a pikin sikapu fourfold , a taigi mi a seefi sani sondee fu di a abi wan ati , fu teke tyali ati fasi 
nathan fu kownu dafeti paansu namo , ne a akisi en taki : “ we , masaa gadu e taki a masaa jesesi , fu a israel taki : ‘ mi anointed yu de , na gaan kownu fu israel , ne mi sipali u komoto a den ana fu sawlesi 
mi o gi en taki : “ mesiti , fosi u de a u de , na household , ne a uman de , na masaa o de a yu ana , da mi o gi yu , ne a israel judah . da , efu i ná e say , da mi o gi i multiply a fosi . 
